{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KeTjcY37MHUFgmPtac7LpT","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/victor/Repos/unwritten/uw-harness-cases/traccar/repo/Makefile has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"38d1d7b6-d88d-475c-865f-50e7106ad4d2","uuid":"38af3113-bf8d-403a-959c-10e4b30738b6","timestamp":"2026-11-01T16:30:40.213Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/Users/victor/Repos/unwritten/uw-harness-cases/traccar/repo/Makefile","oldString":"\t$(GRADLE) assemble\n\t\"$(JAVA_HOME)/bin/java\" -jar target/tracker-server.jar debug.xml","newString":"\t$(GRADLE) assemble\n\t@if [ -d traccar-web/simple ]; then \\\n\t\t\"$(JAVA_HOME)/bin/java\" -jar target/tracker-server.jar debug.xml; \\\n\telse \\\n\t\techo \"traccar-web/simple is missing (submodule not checked out): API only, no web UI. See docs/local-dev.md.\"; \\\n\t\tmkdir -p target/web; \\\n\t\tCONFIG_USE_ENVIRONMENT_VARIABLES=true WEB_PATH=./target/web \\\n\t\t\t\"$(JAVA_HOME)/bin/java\" -jar target/tracker-server.jar debug.xml; \\\n\tfi","originalFile":"# Thin wrapper around the Gradle build. Gradle stays the build tool; this file only gives\n# agents and humans one entry point (setup, dev, gates) and picks a JDK 21+ automatically.\n\n.DEFAULT_GOAL := help\n\nJAVA_HOME := $(shell tools/harness/java-home.sh)\nexport JAVA_HOME\n\nGRADLE := ./gradlew --console=plain -I tools/harness/test-summary.gradle\n\n# Optional test filter, for example: make test TESTS=org.traccar.protocol.Gt06ProtocolDecoderTest\nTESTS ?=\n\n.PHONY: help setup hooks dev build test lint check-fast check db-up db-down clean\n\nhelp: ## List the targets\n\t@grep -E '^[a-zA-Z_-]+:.*## ' $(MAKEFILE_LIST) | awk -F ':.*## ' '{printf \"  %-12s %s\\n\", $$1, $$2}'\n\nsetup: hooks ## Install git hooks and build the server (target/tracker-server.jar, target/lib/)\n\t$(GRADLE) assemble\n\nhooks: ## Point git at the hooks in .githooks (pre-push runs make check-fast)\n\tgit config core.hooksPath .githooks\n\ndev: ## Build and run the server locally with debug.xml (H2 in target/, web on :8082)\n\t$(GRADLE) assemble\n\t\"$(JAVA_HOME)/bin/java\" -jar target/tracker-server.jar debug.xml\n\nbuild: ## Compile and package the server without running checks\n\t$(GRADLE) assemble\n\ntest: ## Run unit tests (TESTS=<class or pattern> to run a subset)\n\t$(GRADLE) test --rerun $(if $(TESTS),--tests '$(TESTS)')\n\nlint: ## Run Checkstyle on main and test sources\n\t$(GRADLE) checkstyleMain checkstyleTest\n\ncheck-fast: ## Fast gate: Checkstyle and unit tests, offline once dependencies are cached\n\t$(GRADLE) checkstyleMain checkstyleTest test --rerun\n\ncheck: ## Full gate: what CI runs (./gradlew build = assemble + Checkstyle + tests)\n\t$(GRADLE) build test --rerun\n\ndb-up: ## Start optional PostgreSQL and MySQL from compose.yaml (H2 needs nothing)\n\tdocker compose up -d\n\ndb-down: ## Stop the optional databases (data volumes are kept)\n\tdocker compose down\n\nclean: ## Delete build output, including the local H2 database in target/\n\t$(GRADLE) clean\n\trm -rf target\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":24,"oldLines":7,"newStart":24,"newLines":14,"lines":[" "," dev: ## Build and run the server locally with debug.xml (H2 in target/, web on :8082)","   $(GRADLE) assemble","-  \"$(JAVA_HOME)/bin/java\" -jar target/tracker-server.jar debug.xml","+  @if [ -d traccar-web/simple ]; then \\","+    \"$(JAVA_HOME)/bin/java\" -jar target/tracker-server.jar debug.xml; \\","+  else \\","+    echo \"traccar-web/simple is missing (submodule not checked out): API only, no web UI. See docs/local-dev.md.\"; \\","+    mkdir -p target/web; \\","+    CONFIG_USE_ENVIRONMENT_VARIABLES=true WEB_PATH=./target/web \\","+      \"$(JAVA_HOME)/bin/java\" -jar target/tracker-server.jar debug.xml; \\","+  fi"," "," build: ## Compile and package the server without running checks","   $(GRADLE) assemble"]}],"userModified":f